cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use inspect-replay in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "inspect-replay: deterministic, sample-aligned comparison of Inspect AI evaluation logs"
abstract: >-
  A command-line tool that compares two Inspect AI .eval logs and reports what
  changed in configuration, headline metrics, samples, scores, and errors. It is
  deterministic, read-only, and deliberate about the difference between
  "unchanged" and "we cannot tell": unrecorded fields are reported as UNKNOWN,
  a comparison that could not be performed is NOT_COMPARABLE rather than a false
  green, and the tool reports co-occurrence rather than asserting causation.
type: software
authors:
